{
    "reasoner_response": "Tell the customer: "Before I transfer you to an agent, I need to collect some information so we can look up the vehicle you are calling about. Can you provide the claim number, contract number, or the last 8 characters of the vehicle's VIN?" Once you have their answer, call me back with the information and specify which type of number they provided (claim, contract, or VIN) so I can proceed.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
